  "description": "Celebrate your special day with Rustic Wedding, an enchanting script typeface that captures a “timeless-and-romantic” soul. This font features elegant, elongated letterforms with a graceful vertical stress and a rhythmic, hand-inked flow that perfectly balances organic charm with professional polish. With its airy proportions and modern aesthetic, Rustic Wedding is the premier choice for independent wedding invitation suites, boutique event branding, artisanal product packaging, and high-impact “shabby-chic-elegance” social media headers.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Celebrate your special day with Rustic Wedding, an enchanting script typeface that captures a “timeless-and-romantic” soul. This font features elegant, elongated letterforms with a graceful vertical stress and a rhythmic, hand-inked flow that perfectly balances organic charm with professional polish. With its airy proportions and modern aesthetic, Rustic Wedding is the premier choice for independent wedding invitation suites, boutique event branding, artisanal product packaging, and high-impact “shabby-chic-elegance” social media headers.</p>",
